1
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:36,000
Master, I have bad news!

2
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,000
-What's the trouble?
-Magistrate Shi is here!

3
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:46,480
That's bad news indeed.
Quick, hide all our valuables

4
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:49,480
Keep the ginseng, bird's nest,
antiques etc out of sight!

5
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,400
Please be seated, Your Excellency

6
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Kindly accept this gift

7
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:04,000
I'm paying you a New Year call.
You don't have to do this

8
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,720
It's a small token of my regard

9
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,320
Serve tea!

10
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:09,000
Have tea, Your Excellency

11
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,480
You've raised an excellent son,
Mr Wei

12
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:15,000
Has Delu got himself
into trouble again?

13
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,000
He's been spreading
malicious rumours,

14
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
saying I used the relief funds to
throw a birthday party for my mother

15
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,480
This is making me very angry

16
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Please don't be angry. I'll get him
to apologize to you when he returns

17
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
There, he's back

18
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Father, what's he doing here?

19
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Lu!
Pay your respects to the Magistrate

20
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,480
Master Wei is too proud
to kowtow to anybody

21
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Lu, pay your respects
to His Excellency

22
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,640
Go on.
Only a fool goes looking for trouble

23
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,560
Go on

24
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,800
My respects to Your Excellency

25
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:15,000
You've been going around saying that
I collected relief funds...

26
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
and splurged them on
a birthday feast for my mother

27
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:22,600
How am I going to face the people
I'm supposed to govern now?

28
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:28,000
If you don't want people to know
something, don't do it

29
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:33,000
Your Excellency,
my son is young and impetuous

30
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Please don't take offence.
Let him off this once

31
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,480
I know he is young and impetuous

32
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:44,000
I'm prepared to forget the matter
if he will kneel before me

33
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:49,800
You want me to kneel before you?
You've got to be joking

34
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,000
This is neither a court nor a temple
nor the throne room

35
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,480
Why should I get down on my knees?

36
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:01,000
Besides, it is said that
there is gold under a man's knees

37
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,000
How can I kneel for no good reason?

38
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,000
I take it you won't do it?

39
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,000
Lu, just look at you

40
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,000
I'll do anything you ask of me,
Your Excellency

41
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,480
Father!

42
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,640
Don't do it

43
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,000
Let me

44
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:33,000
What? I'm a bit hard of hearing.
Can you repeat that?

45
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:39,000
I will offer you tea on bended knees

46
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:46,000
You're going to offer tea to
a lowly magistrate? I'm flattered

47
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,000
Go ahead then

48
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Or must you remove the gold
under your knees first?

49
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:06,480
Please accept this cup of tea,
Your Excellency

50
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:11,000
He's already on his knees,
Your Excellency. Do forgive him

51
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:14,000
You're not good at
disciplining your son

52
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Allow me to take him in hand
on your behalf

53
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,560
Go ahead

54
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:24,600
Han Xin had to suffer the humiliation
of crawling beneath someone's crotch..

55
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,000
before he could become
a great general

56
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:31,000
If you want your son
to get ahead in life,

57
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:35,000
tell him to emulate Han Xin
and crawl beneath my crotch

58
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:41,000
He should count himself lucky
to be given this honour

59
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,400
Not everyone gets this opportunity

60
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:58,000
What are you waiting for?
Hurry up and do it

61
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,000
I trust you like its taste

62
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:15,400
How dare you!

63
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:19,000
You asked for it.
You have only yourself to blame

64
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
You're going to pay for this!

65
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:24,000
Men! Arrest him!

66
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,000
What are you trying to do?
Let go of me!

67
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,720
I can walk by myself

68
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:36,000
Don't worry, Father.
Everything will be fine

69
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:02,000
Ma-gu, what a surprise.
Have you come up here for a visit?

70
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:07,000
I've brought the Lady Queen Mother
some special wine I made

71
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:13,000
Her Ladyship is away, unfortunately.
Let me sample the wine for her

72
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:18,000
Don't get up to any idea.
The wine is meant for her Ladyship

73
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,800
It's too bad

74
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:23,000
On the contrary. It's perfect

75
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
What are you talking about?

76
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:29,000
With both the Jade Emperor and
the Lady Queen Mother away,

77
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:31,480
the celestial court
is virtually empty

78
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:35,000
Someone can take this opportunity
to find out...

79
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:39,000
how the three deities
are doing in the mortal world

80
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:44,000
The pot calling the kettle black.
You're here for the same purpose

81
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Sh, not so loud!

82
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:50,000
We won't get to see anything
if the celestial soldiers find out

83
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:59,000
Stop there!

84
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:06,480
She's going to beat me

85
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:10,000
Come out here, you little minx!
I'm talking to you!

86
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:17,000
Be good, Jiujin.
Do as Uncle says and stop crying

87
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:21,000
You won't look pretty if you cry.
Hush now

88
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:24,000
There's a good girl

89
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:29,480
You'll grow up to be a pretty girl
if you smile more. Go on, smile

90
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:36,000
You really have a way with her.
She's actually stopped crying

91
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:42,000
Her mother has no control over her.
She only listens to you

92
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:48,480
That's right. She's close to
her uncle. I'm nobody to her

93
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:55,000
You should mind what you say
in front of your child

94
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,560
Right, Jiujin?

95
00:08:56,560 --> 00:09:01,560
We are all family.
Why should you mind so much?

96
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:06,000
We are family?
I really doubt it, Mother

97
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:10,000
This house belongs to you
and this shop, to Shou

98
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
I get nothing

99
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:18,000
There you go again. You resent your
father for not leaving you anything

100
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:21,000
But you're living with us,
aren't you?

101
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Shou hasn't raised any objection

102
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:29,000
You make it sound as if I'm demanding
a share of the family fortune

103
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:33,000
Yes, I'm your married daughter.
But I still belong to this family

104
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,000
Don't be afraid, Jiujin

105
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:39,480
Cai and I chose to stay here so
we can take care of you and Father

106
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:45,000
And we're helping to run the shop
because of Shou's poor health

107
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:57,000
I have to toil for a living,
unlike my pampered brother

108
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,480
Are you all right, Uncle?

109
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,600
Shou!

110
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:08,600
What's the matter?
My precious son, are you all right?

111
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,000
My stomach... hurts

112
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,600
How is he, Doctor Jin?

113
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:21,000
Don't keep shaking your head.
You're making me very nervous

114
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:27,000
Your son's condition
is nothing serious

115
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:32,000
It's indigestion caused by
excessive eating and drinking

116
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:35,000
I'll write out a prescription for
him. He'll be fine after two doses

117
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:41,000
Rhubarb, honey, pharbitis seeds
and lilac daphne

118
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,800
Let me have a look

119
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Doctor, is this
the right prescription?

120
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:53,000
I have gastric trouble.
Why do you prescribe me a laxative?

121
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Nonsense. How can a physician
give a wrong prescription?

122
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:59,000
You've made a mistake

123
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:05,000
I came to you the last time
after eating contaminated food

124
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:10,000
You prescribed rhubarb, honey,
pharbitis seeds and lilac daphne...

125
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:13,000
to expel the harmful substances
from my body

126
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:16,000
Your memory is playing tricks on you

127
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,600
No, it's not

128
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Mother...
I have the prescription with me

129
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:27,000
See for yourself.
Aren't the two exactly the same?

130
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,400
Doctor, how do you explain this?

131
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:36,480
Both prescriptions are for gastric
trouble, so of course they're the same

132
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,480
They shouldn't be

133
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:43,000
I needed to be purged the last time
after eating contaminated food

134
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:46,000
But I'm having indigestion this time

135
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Shouldn't you give me something
to ease my discomfort?

136
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,480
Isn't he right?

137
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:54,200
Don't listen to him

138
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:57,000
I've been his physician
since he was little

139
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Has he ever come to any harm?

140
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:03,000
Yes, I have

141
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:08,000
Once, thanks to a wrong prescription
you gave me,

142
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:13,000
a common cold I had
dragged on for over two months

143
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,600
Nothing of the sort!

144
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:20,000
I have the prescription with me
as well. Take a look

145
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:24,480
Don't blame me for
your weak disposition

146
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:28,000
You're the one who's trying
to put the blame on me

147
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:33,000
I've brought along all the wrong
prescriptions you gave me

148
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,000
You're being difficult!

149
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:40,400
Please don't be offended

150
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:43,000
He's trying to give me a hard time!

151
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:46,600
But it's true that you gave me
wrong prescriptions

152
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:52,000
I've had enough, Mrs Mei.
Find yourself another physician

153
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:56,000
Mother!
Let him go

154
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Do you like this orange?

155
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,800
Oh, yes

156
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:19,000
-It's made of pure gold
-Excellent!

157
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:23,400
So will you have mercy on
my friend Lu and release him?

158
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:25,400
Who says anything
about releasing him?

159
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,400
But I gave you...

160
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:33,000
That's a different matter entirely.
This is supposed to be a gift

161
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,560
You!

162
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:39,000
Your Excellency,
what have you in mind?

163
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,000
Five hundred taels

164
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,560
Five hundred taels!

165
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:50,480
That's a lot of money. Enough
to last a poor family a lifetime

166
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:54,000
Please don't put Uncle Wei in a spot

167
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:58,480
Tell you what,
let's meet each other halfway

168
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:01,480
Let's make it fifty taels

169
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:04,000
What?
I want at least three hundred taels!

170
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,560
Who are you?

171
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:13,000
I'm Joined Brow,
the Number One Villain!

172
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:19,000
Joined Brow?
Men, arrest him!

173
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,560
Get him!

174
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:34,000
I want the safe return of my fellow
disciple Gem-faced Leopard in 3 days,

175
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:37,000
or I shall raze this place
to the ground!

176
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:44,000
I hear you've hired the top lady
constable Golden Swallow to arrest me

177
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:47,000
I can't wait to see
what she can do to me

178
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:51,000
I don't know where she is.
She comes and goes mysteriously

179
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:55,000
Make it known that
I'm waiting for her

180
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,400
I'm going to twist her head off
when I see her!

181
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:05,000
I'll accept this
as a present from you

182
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:12,000
That fiend...

183
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:18,400
What a guy.
He's my kind of hero!

184
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:35,000
This road leads to the Green Dragon
Fort. Don't tell me...?

185
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:46,000
It's Uncle Wei's gold orange.
What a lucky find

186
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:52,000
How dare you follow me!
Do you have a death wish?

187
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Great swordsman,
I'm willing to be your disciple

188
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,000
I saw how you fought off
the magistrate's men

189
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,600
It gladdened my heart

190
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:05,800
You're quick-witted, I admit

191
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:10,000
I really would like
to become your disciple

192
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:12,480
I will follow you from now on

193
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,400
-You mean it?
-Yes

194
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:17,400
If I lie, may I die a horrible death

195
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:20,000
Don't forget you said that

196
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:27,000
My hand...
What's happened?

197
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:30,000
The gold orange is coated with poison

198
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:35,000
Is your hand getting numb?

199
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,000
Yes

200
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Are there black spots on your palm?

201
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:39,600
Yes!

202
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,320
You'll be dead pretty soon

203
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:46,000
Save me, Teacher.
Give me the antidote

204
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:49,480
Why should I save you?
You're no student of mine

205
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:53,000
I really worship you, Teacher

206
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:55,000
I saw with my own eyes...

207
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:02,000
how you punished the wicked
and defended the down-trodden

208
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:05,000
I was filled with admiration for you

209
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
Enough of your flattery

210
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:16,000
Very well, I'll save you this once
seeing what a boot-licker you are

211
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,800
How does it feel?

212
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,000
It feels cool

213
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,000
Hey, the black spots are gone

214
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:34,000
Teacher, what a great healer you are.
I owe you my life

215
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:39,400
Enough of that.
We'll go our separate ways. Farewell

216
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:45,000
Teacher, please help my friend
since you're such a great healer

217
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:49,000
He's gravely ill.
Will you take a look at him?

218
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,480
Why should I bother
about your friend?

219
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:59,000
In return for your helping my friend,
I will rescue Gem-faced Leopard

220
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,000
What makes you think you can?

221
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:09,000
Don't underestimate me.
I'm really smart and resourceful

222
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,560
What's your plan?

223
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:15,000
We'll launch a rescue mission

224
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:21,000
With your superb fighting skills
and my brains,

225
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:25,000
we'll make a formidable pair

226
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:30,600
The medicine is ready, Shou.
Drink it and you'll soon be well

227
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:34,000
I don't want any more medicine,
Mother

228
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,400
It will only make me more sick

229
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:41,000
Uncle seems to be getting worse

230
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:44,000
His cold has developed into
a stomachache

231
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:47,000
I don't know what medicine
to give him

232
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,800
Mrs Mei!

233
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:54,480
There's hope for Shou.
I've found him an excellent physician

234
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:58,000
You? Is he reliable?

235
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:02,000
He's my teacher and
a man of great knowledge

236
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:06,480
He could be a charlatan.
Don't get Shou into a worse state

237
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:10,400
Shou is my good friend.
Would I do that to him?

238
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,000
He's burning up

239
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,000
Where are you taking him?

240
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:21,000
Let me give it a try. It's better
than leaving him here to die

241
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:25,000
Heaven forbid! Nothing good
ever comes out of your mouth

242
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:30,480
All right, I won't say another word.
Just let me give it a try

243
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,600
Hurry, Teacher!

244
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,000
Take a look at him

245
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:44,000
Is his condition serious?

246
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:51,000
The average physician
will not be able to cure him

247
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:55,480
But you're lucky to have met me,
so don't worry

248
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,400
Please do whatever you can for him

249
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:05,000
Wait. You haven't told me yet how
you plan to save my fellow disciple

250
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:08,400
I've had it all worked out

251
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:10,000
Let's hear it

252
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:15,000
There'll be lots of people lined up
on the road to the execution ground

253
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:18,000
In order to rescue Gem-faced Leopard,

254
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:22,000
you'll have to create
some sort of confusion

255
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:25,600
You mean...?

256
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:29,000
I will help you create a diversion

257
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:33,480
While the townsfolk are otherwise
engaged, you'll make your getaway

258
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:38,000
You're not my student for nothing

259
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:43,600
But what you just said
has given me an even better idea

260
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:47,000
You're my teacher.
I am no match for you

261
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:50,000
What is your plan?

262
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:52,000
Smoke bombs

263
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,000
-Smoke bombs?
-Exactly

264
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:58,000
That's not advisable.
A lot of people will get killed

265
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:03,000
I only want to create a diversion
so I can carry out the rescue

266
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:07,000
But you might get hurt
in the process...

267
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:11,000
Stop acting like an old woman!

268
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:14,000
Do you want to save my fellow
disciple and your friend?

269
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,600
Then shut up.
Get out of my way

270
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,000
Shou, are you all right?

271
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:34,000
Yes

272
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:38,600
Give him this pill.
I'll go get the smoke bombs

273
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:42,000
-What bombs?
-He meant fireworks

274
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:44,000
-Who is he?
-Joined Brow

275
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,600
What's this?

276
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:53,000
Here, you keep it.
You're supposed to take it

277
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:27,000
There's grit in my food

278
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:30,000
A few pieces of grit won't kill you

279
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:37,600
Have the food changed.
This is inedible

280
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:43,000
We don't provide fine dining here.
If you're not used to it...

281
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:48,000
You'll let me starve, is that it?

282
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:54,000
I can make things better for you
if you comply with the rules

283
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:56,200
Rules? What rules?

284
00:22:56,600 --> 00:22:58,200
Listen good

285
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:04,000
Tell your father to bring me gifts
every other day,

286
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:09,000
and I guarantee you will
eat and live well here

287
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:12,000
Who set these rules?

288
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:14,000
Lord Chang Ren did

289
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:17,000
Lord Chang Ren?

290
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:22,000
Never heard of him

291
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:26,000
What rank does he hold?

292
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:31,000
He's a brilliant man. Not even the
top officials in court are his match

293
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:34,480
He rules this place.
You're looking at him now

294
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,000
I see

295
00:23:38,480 --> 00:23:42,000
Like the saying goes,
"Fish begins to stink at the head!"

296
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:44,320
Scum like you ought to be shot!

297
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:48,480
You're turning on me when
I'm trying to help you?

298
00:23:48,480 --> 00:23:53,000
The first thing I'll do when I get
out of here is to have you prosecuted

299
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:55,000
Just try it

300
00:23:55,000 --> 00:24:00,000
I'll take the case all the way up
to the Emperor if I have to

301
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:02,560
See if that doesn't strike fear
into you!

302
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:09,000
Lord Chang Ren, did you say?
I'll remember the name

303
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:14,480
Get me a fresh bowl of rice

304
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:27,000
How could you still laugh?
I'm sick with worry

305
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:31,000
Don't you think the Jade Emperor
is carrying the joke too far?

306
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:35,000
Those three were insufferably
conceited when they were here

307
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:38,600
But things aren't working so well
for them in the mortal world

308
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:57,000
How could you still laugh?
I'm sick with worry

309
00:24:58,000 --> 00:25:01,000
Don't you think Jade Emperor
is carrying the joke too far?

310
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:05,000
Those three were insufferably
conceited when they were here

311
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:08,600
But things aren't working so well
for them in the mortal world

312
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:13,000
I thought you were
on good terms with them

313
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:16,000
But here you are,
gloating over their misfortune

314
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:20,000
I always get dragged into it whenever
they land themselves in trouble

315
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:25,000
But this time,
I can watch them suffer with glee

316
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:28,000
So don't expect any sympathy from me

317
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:31,000
Enough of that.
Try and find a way to help them

318
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:35,000
At this rate, Longevity
will soon breathe his last,

319
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:37,000
Prosperity will turn dumb,

320
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:43,000
and Fortune will likely blow up
the temple of the town god

321
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:46,000
It's not your temple,
so why should you worry?

322
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:51,000
The three of them have to undergo
many trials and tribulations...

323
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:53,000
before they can return

324
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:58,000
This will teach them a lesson so
they'll behave themselves in future

325
00:26:01,600 --> 00:26:04,000
They've been in the mortal world
for 28 years

326
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:08,480
If they fail to accomplish the tasks
set for them before they reach 30,

327
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:10,400
they won't be able to come back

328
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:15,000
They'll be condemned to a terrible
fate and banned from returning

329
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:18,000
They'll be stripped of
their immortal status

330
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:23,000
I thought the Jade Emperor was
joking. Did he really mean it?

331
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:28,000
Was he joking when he sent you to
muck out the stables as a punishment?

332
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:32,600
What should we do?

333
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:38,000
If only the Goddess of Mercy
would help...

334
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:44,000
I know of a merciful goddess

335
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:48,480
What do you intend to do to trick
the goddess into helping you?

336
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:54,000
This little goddess I have in mind
is kind-hearted, pretty, gentle,

337
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:59,000
bright, hardworking,
selfless and helpful

338
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:05,480
Is there such a goddess?
How come I don't remember her?

339
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:10,000
Who is she? Tell me

340
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:16,000
-Oh, so you planned this!
-Not so loud

341
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:22,000
Forget it. I'm not going to
get myself involved this time

342
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:29,000
I'm just a selfish and self-
preserving immortal, not a goddess

343
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:31,600
You go to their rescue if you want

344
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Have a heart, Ma-gu

345
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:41,000
I have to go on inspection tours
with the Eight Immortals every day

346
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:45,480
I also have meetings to attend
and prayer lists to peruse

347
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:47,480
How can I possibly get away?

348
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:53,000
Do you think I'm your slave
to be ordered about?

349
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:58,000
I wouldn't dare dream of
ordering you about

350
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:03,000
You're a favourite of
the Lady Queen Mother

351
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:11,000
We have to rely on you to put in
a good word with her for us

352
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:17,000
I'm just a nobody whose words
carry little weight

353
00:28:17,480 --> 00:28:21,000
I'm busy with unimportant
little tasks every day

354
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:23,600
I'm counting on your help

355
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:30,000
Still, what is there I can do?

356
00:28:30,800 --> 00:28:35,000
You can do a lot of things.
This is nothing to you

357
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:39,000
You must get them out of the
dangerous situations they're in...

358
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:42,000
and slowly guide them back
to the right path

359
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:45,000
They're two years short of thirty

360
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:49,000
With your help, they can accomplish
their mission and return

361
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:53,000
But it's against the rules to
descend to earth without permission

362
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:56,000
One has to break the rules
to achieve greatness

363
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:58,000
What nonsense is that?

364
00:28:58,000 --> 00:29:02,480
Which of the many renowned immortals
have not broken celestial rules?

365
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:08,000
Lu Dongbin fell in love
with a woman

366
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:12,000
The Monkey God wreaked havoc
in the heavenly palace

367
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:14,480
Chang E stole the immortality pills

368
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:20,000
The Holy Mother of Mount Huashan and
the Seven Fairy Maidens married humans

369
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:24,000
And what happened?
Their names are forever remembered

370
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:28,000
You've always been law-abiding

371
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:33,000
But you're not even among
the top ten most famous immortals

372
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:35,000
Isn't it unfair?

373
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:38,000
You're prettier than the others

374
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:41,000
You know how to grow peaches
and make wine

375
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:44,000
You're much more capable
than any other fairy maidens

376
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:47,000
What you lack is opportunity

377
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:48,560
Opportunity?

378
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:50,560
Yes, to make a name for yourself

379
00:29:50,560 --> 00:29:54,560
This is your chance.
You should seize it

380
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:58,000
You've got a silver tongue,
but I'm no simpleton

381
00:29:58,480 --> 00:30:03,000
I'm not ambitious.
I want happiness more than fame

382
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:08,800
The Queen Mother's birthday
is still a long time away

383
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:14,000
Why don't you make use of the time
to visit the three deities?

384
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:19,000
It'll be nice to take some time off
from your busy schedule

385
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:21,000
Besides, I'm behind you

386
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:26,000
If anyone asks, just say you're
on an inspection tour on my behalf

387
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:28,480
You're not really breaking any rule

388
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:31,000
-But...
-But what?

389
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:33,000
Come and take a look

390
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:39,000
See, their lives are in danger.
You've got to help them

391
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:42,000
One's face reveals one's heart

392
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:45,000
A pretty fairy maiden like you
must surely have a good heart

393
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:48,000
Besides, the three deities
saved your life once

394
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:52,480
You wouldn't be where you are now
if not for them

395
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:56,000
One good turn deserves another

396
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:59,000
Even human beings know that,
what more we immortals

397
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:03,000
You say the three of them
often bully you

398
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:08,000
This is your chance
to get back at them

399
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:13,000
When they return, you'll be known
as their guardian deity

400
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:22,000
Listen, you won't be alone.
You have my backing

401
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:27,000
You'll descend to earth to get them
out of the mess they're in

402
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:29,000
I'll remain here as your backup

403
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:35,600
Well, it's settled then.
I'll leave everything to you

404
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:49,000
Why don't you all go home?
I'll guard the prisoner

405
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:57,000
Wei Delu...

406
00:31:57,000 --> 00:32:02,000
I'm going to cause your tongue
to rot and drop

407
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:06,000
You won't be able to talk,
much less report me

408
00:32:06,480 --> 00:32:08,480
Wei Delu...

409
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:39,000
Shou, how will you get well if you
gorge yourself on such oily food?

410
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:43,000
Don't worry, Mother.
Fu took me to see his teacher

411
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:48,000
He gave me a pill
that's guaranteed to cure me

412
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,800
So have you taken it?

413
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:51,320
No

414
00:33:51,320 --> 00:33:55,000
And you're still eating such rich
food? Do you mean to kill yourself?

415
00:33:56,000 --> 00:34:00,000
Don't worry, Mother.
I avoided a lot of food in the past

416
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:06,600
But now that I have this miraculous
pill, I can eat without a care

417
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:09,000
You're such a greedy boy

418
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:12,000
Where's the pill?

419
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:19,000
It's huge.
Can you swallow it?

420
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:23,000
Of course. The bigger the pill,
the more potent it is

421
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:27,000
Can this healer be trusted?

422
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:30,000
Sure. He's a friend of Fu

423
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:35,000
That's what worries me. Bad luck
follows him wherever he goes

424
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:39,400
Stop fussing.
I'm going to take the pill now

425
00:34:44,600 --> 00:34:47,000
You're going to swallow it
just like that?

426
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:51,000
How else should I do it?
It's all right, don't worry

427
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:03,000
Help! Somebody!
Come quick!

428
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:05,000
Help your young master!

429
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:30,640
What do you think you're doing?

430
00:36:32,400 --> 00:36:34,000
You were in danger just now?

431
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:36,600
You've ruined our plan!

432
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:43,000
Fu!
You've ruined my plan!

433
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,600
Wretched woman!

434
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:10,480
Oh no, Mei Shouquan is in a bad way

435
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:16,000
Golden Swallow?

436
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:30,000
Slowly...

437
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:33,000
Hurry!

438
00:37:39,600 --> 00:37:41,320
Here's your food

439
00:37:41,600 --> 00:37:43,200
Leave it there

440
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,480
You!

441
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:01,480
Careful

442
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:24,000
Shou, are you all right?

443
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:31,000
Wait. You saved my son but
I still don't know your name

444
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:35,600
If my guess is right,
she is Golden Swallow

445
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:40,000
She's the top lady constable
in the Capital

446
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:43,000
Don't deny it.
Your fighting skills say it all

447
00:38:44,000 --> 00:38:48,000
So you're the top woman constable
from the Capital

448
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:52,480
She saved your son, Mrs Mei.
Fortune is with your family

449
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:55,000
Thank you so much

450
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:58,480
What is your name?
How should we address you?

451
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:00,400
My surname is Ma

452
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:04,000
Swordswoman Ma,
it's a pleasure to meet you

453
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:09,000
Shou, don't just sit there.
Come and meet Swordswoman Ma

454
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:12,000
It's an honour your friend
Wei Delu doesn't have

455
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:17,000
Wei Delu is in trouble.
Sorry, I have to go

456
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:33,000
Who's that?
What a rude thing to do!

457
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,480
Come out!

458
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:58,480
That was a rude thing to do,
depriving me of my lunch

459
00:39:58,480 --> 00:40:00,480
I saved your life, mind you

460
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:03,320
Who are you?
How did you get in?

461
00:40:03,600 --> 00:40:07,000
He put poison in your food
to turn you dumb

462
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:11,000
Who are you? How did you know?

463
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:14,000
If you don't want people to
know something, don't do it

464
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:15,800
Don't be rude!

465
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:17,600
Your Excellency

466
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:20,600
She is the top lady constable,
Golden Swallow

467
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:23,000
Please pardon me

468
00:40:24,000 --> 00:40:28,600
Hear this, Shi Yaoqian.
You're not to kill Wei Delu

469
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:31,000
I'm taking him away with me

470
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:33,000
Where are you taking me?

471
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:35,000
Don't ask

472
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:38,480
I'm afraid I can't let you do that

473
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:42,000
He's my spy.
I want you to release him

474
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:43,600
Certainly

475
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:47,000
One more thing.
He tried to poison Wei Delu

476
00:40:47,000 --> 00:40:48,600
He must be punished

477
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:50,560
Yes

478
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:52,600
Come with me

479
00:40:52,600 --> 00:40:54,400
Let me get my clothes

480
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:58,800
-Stop following me
-I'm going home with you

481
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,480
Go home with me?

482
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:07,000
I want to make sure you serve the
people and perform meritorious service

483
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:10,000
That way, you can return
before you turn 30,

484
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:12,000
and I will accomplish my mission

485
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:19,000
I don't know what you're talking
about. You sound like a mad woman

486
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:24,000
I came all the way here to save you,
and you call me a mad woman?

487
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Let me ask you this

488
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:30,000
Of the four virtues of women,
which comes first?

489
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:34,000
Morality comes before modest manner,
proper speech and diligent work

490
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:36,000
So you realize that

491
00:41:36,000 --> 00:41:39,000
It's bad enough for a woman
to brandish a weapon

492
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:41,600
But you were even pulling at
my clothes

493
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:48,000
Folks, this young woman pulled at
my clothes right here on the street

494
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:51,480
Doesn't that breach the rules
of proper female behaviour?

495
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:57,000
A woman without talent is thereby
virtuous. Mind your behaviour

496
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:02,480
I'm surprised you hold such
outdated and bigoted views

497
00:42:03,000 --> 00:42:05,000
I hold outdated views?

498
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:10,000
Haven't you heard that
women are the bane of men?

499
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:13,480
Tell me, what is the most
desired virtue in a man?

500
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:16,000
Kindness, of course

501
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:21,000
Why then are you so unkind as to
insult every woman in the world?

502
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:28,000
The patriotism of Xishi and
Zhaojun is greatly admired by all

503
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:31,000
The determination of Mencius' mother
that her son be brought up well;

504
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:33,000
Ti Ying's valiant attempt
to save her father;

505
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:36,600
Mulan's filial piety
and Bao Gu's altruism -

506
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:39,000
in what way were they a bane of men?

507
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:43,000
There have been monarchs who caused
the fall of their dynasties,

508
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:46,000
and scholars and generals who were
unfaithful to their spouses

509
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:49,000
Why do you conveniently omit
to mention them?

510
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:56,400
Shall I tell him about these men
to improve his general knowledge?

511
00:42:58,480 --> 00:43:02,000
King Zhou and the First Emperor of
the Qin Dynasty were both despots

512
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:06,000
Lu Bu was faithless while Zhao Gao
persecuted loyal officials

513
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:08,800
How can you call them
good and honourable men?

514
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:14,000
You've made such derogatory remarks
about women

515
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:17,000
I take it you think
men are superior to women?

516
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:19,600
But of course

517
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:22,000
I don't understand this

518
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:25,000
If I can offer my service
to the imperial court,

519
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:29,000
why do you waste away your life
in this small town?

520
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:31,000
What is your reason?

521
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:37,000
Wealth and rank are as transient
as a fleeting cloud

522
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:39,000
I do not hanker after them

523
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:41,000
Treacherous ministers are in power

524
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:45,000
I'd be holding a candle to the devil
if I became an official

525
00:43:46,000 --> 00:43:50,000
We need upright officials in these
troubled times. Don't tell me...?

526
00:43:50,000 --> 00:43:51,560
What?

527
00:43:51,800 --> 00:43:55,480
Are you afraid of failing
the imperial examination?

528
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Nonsense.
As if I would fail

529
00:44:06,000 --> 00:44:10,000
Then the only explanation is that
you don't wish to serve the people

530
00:44:12,000 --> 00:44:14,000
If you want to win my respect,

531
00:44:14,000 --> 00:44:18,600
you must succeed in the imperial
examination and win an official rank

532
00:44:41,480 --> 00:44:43,480
I'll show you


